[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14102.79, "timestamp": "03:55:02", "text": "我认为你不能跳过这扇门。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14106.79, "timestamp": "03:55:06", "text": "哪扇门？啊，直的。直的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14115.51, "timestamp": "03:55:15", "text": "就像你可以跳过去那样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14118.229, "timestamp": "03:55:18", "text": "你可以跳过一些门"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14120.07, "timestamp": "03:55:20", "text": "就像我可能在你处于更高阶段的时候一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14122.87, "timestamp": "03:55:22", "text": "然后你可以轻松跳过这个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14126.229, "timestamp": "03:55:26", "text": "那些。啊，让我给你看看。好的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14130.55, "timestamp": "03:55:30", "text": "不行，温度太低了，而且火也烧没了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14140.79, "timestamp": "03:55:40", "text": "不用等了。你是怎么死的？我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14144.469, "timestamp": "03:55:44", "text": "及时蹲下。那是一个笑脸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14148.15, "timestamp": "03:55:48", "text": "等等，你应该还活着才对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14151.67, "timestamp": "03:55:51", "text": "哦，这他妈什么鬼？等等，你在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14154.07, "timestamp": "03:55:54", "text": "我死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14156.95, "timestamp": "03:55:56", "text": "我的天啊。哦，你正在你的"}]